<title>USA: Omaha cattle firm - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle firm - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers fairly active, firm.</p>
<p>Steers: Select to more Choice 2-4 1100-1350 lbs 73.50-75.00, two shipments 75.50. Select 70.00-73.00.</p>
<p>Heifers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1000-1250 lbs 73.00-75.00, load reputation fed 75.50. Select 70.00-73.00.</p>
</text>
